{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40010","headline":"依韵赠严司直 · 徐夤","name":"依韵赠严司直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾转双蓬到玉京，宣尼恩奏乐卿名。\n歌残白石扣牛角，赋换黄金爱马卿。\n沧海二隅身渐老，太行千叠路难行。\n夫君才大官何小，堪恨人间事不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}